    - target: {fileID: 8881028038475493880, guid: fd28f23af44f73f4a95e33435872ad15, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_Text
      value: 'You can scroll this window using the scrollbars, or by using the thumbstick
        on your controller.


        The controller ray must be pointed at the UI
        element you wish to scroll for the thumbstick to work.


        Your Job
        is to prevent the energy station from breaking down, you will have to rush
        through rooms, completing puzzles in order to open doors and progress through,
        however there are corrupted robots that have been corrupted by fossil fuels
        that will be trying to beat you there, if they get past the room before you,
        all hope is lost. You are our last hope, dont let renwable energy fall'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
